issue_texts.102:
stringifyYAML writes invalid nesting for values parsed from a flat YAML document

### Environment

confbox 0.3.1 (current `main`), Node.js 22.

### Reproduction

```js
import { parseYAML, stringifyYAML } from "confbox";

const config = parseYAML("a: 1\n");
config.b = { c: [1, 2] };

const out = stringifyYAML(config);
console.log(JSON.stringify(out));
// "a: 1\nb:\nc:\n- 1\n- 2\n"

console.log(parseYAML(out));
// { a: 1, b: null, c: [ 1, 2 ] }
```

### Expected

```yaml
a: 1
b:
  c:
    - 1
    - 2
```

### Actual

Nested keys are written at column 0, so `b` becomes `null` and `c` moves to the top level. No error is raised. The same happens for a document whose only nesting is a zero-indented sequence, for example `list:\n- a\n`.

### Cause

`parseYAML` stores a sample of the source, and `stringifyYAML` passes the indent that `detect-indent` finds in it to `js-yaml`'s `dump`. A document without indented lines yields an indent of `""`, so `dump` runs with `indent: 0`.

problem_statement:
stringifyYAML writes invalid nesting for values parsed from a flat YAML document

### Environment

confbox 0.3.1 (current `main`), Node.js 22.

### Reproduction

```js
import { parseYAML, stringifyYAML } from "confbox";

const config = parseYAML("a: 1\n");
config.b = { c: [1, 2] };

const out = stringifyYAML(config);
console.log(JSON.stringify(out));
// "a: 1\nb:\nc:\n- 1\n- 2\n"

console.log(parseYAML(out));
// { a: 1, b: null, c: [ 1, 2 ] }
```

### Expected

```yaml
a: 1
b:
  c:
    - 1
    - 2
```

### Actual

Nested keys are written at column 0, so `b` becomes `null` and `c` moves to the top level. No error is raised. The same happens for a document whose only nesting is a zero-indented sequence, for example `list:\n- a\n`.

### Cause

`parseYAML` stores a sample of the source, and `stringifyYAML` passes the indent that `detect-indent` finds in it to `js-yaml`'s `dump`. A document without indented lines yields an indent of `""`, so `dump` runs with `indent: 0`.

gold_patch:
diff --git a/src/yaml.ts b/src/yaml.ts
index 004ec1a..a352815 100644
--- a/src/yaml.ts
+++ b/src/yaml.ts
@@ -39,10 +39,11 @@ export function parseYAML<T = unknown>(text: string, options?: YAMLParseOptions)
  */
 export function stringifyYAML(value: any, options?: YAMLStringifyOptions): string {
   const format = getFormat(value, { preserveIndentation: false });
-  const indentSize = typeof format.indent === "string" ? format.indent.length : format.indent;
+  const detectedIndent = typeof format.indent === "string" ? format.indent.length : format.indent;
   const str = dump(value, {
-    indent: indentSize,
     ...options,
+    // A flat document has no indentation to detect, but YAML needs a non-zero indent for nesting.
+    indent: options?.indent || detectedIndent || 2,
   });
   return format.whitespace.start + str.trim() + format.whitespace.end;
 }

